# JavaScript

- Functional-first style by default; match repo conventions first.
- Prefer small pure functions and explicit data flow.
- Don’t convert JS↔TS unless explicitly requested.
- Avoid adding dependencies unless necessary and justified.
- Keep changes minimal and include tests when behavior changes (per global rule).
